sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as Interviewer
    participant C as Candidate
    participant B as Board
    I->>C: here is the product
    C->>I: functional requirements — what must it do?
    C->>I: non-functional — scale, latency, consistency
    C->>B: the core entities and the API between them
    C->>B: high-level design, data flow first
    I->>C: now go deep on one piece
    C->>B: partitioning, hot keys, and the read/write split
    C->>B: what breaks at 10x, and the fix
    Note over C,B: the deep dive is what the interview is actually scored on
